<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Solar installation in Enugu starts with two questions: how many hours of light you actually get, and how much petrol or diesel the gen burns to cover the rest. In Independence Layout, Trans-Ekulu, GRA, New Haven or Abakpa, the first step is the same: get two or three written quotes that list the exact inverter, battery and panel models.</p><p>This page is advertising for independent Nigerian solar installers. It does not install or sell anything itself. Call now on +234 809 000 0000, and the installer who quotes your job will work from your own appliances. Every price below is a figure published by a named seller or outlet in a stated month, and a current written quote is the only real number.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Enugu</span>
