        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Home solar installation in Enugu</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A hybrid system for a duplex or flat in Enugu, sized from your own appliances' rating plates and not from a guess. The installer should also look at your actual roof before quoting.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Inverter and battery installation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">For an old inverter with tubular batteries that no longer last the night. An installer can quote a lithium swap or a new hybrid inverter and tell you what your existing wiring and DB can carry.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
