        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Shops, schools, clinics, churches and small offices in Enugu that want to cut diesel. The installer works from a load audit of your daytime equipment and the hours you run.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
